Legend:
* FlowerVariationOds data: denotes what the section is defining; think of it as the subsection title
* ID (first one): flower variation internal ID number
* Species: plant species internal ID number
* Int8 color: 1-9 (mostly) for solid colors, 10+ for hybrids
* probability: related to the color's chance to grow from seed? hybrids are all 0
* HW hash (originally "LocalizationHash languageHash"), SInt64 longHash, int intHash: hash codes for the variation's hedgehog words; can ignore this
* int receivePrice: how many gold petals to receive the variation on a gift hedgehog



* "Theme N/A" themes do not appear in-game; based on localization files they would be named "Annual Grass," ("一年草の花") "Year-End Grass," ("越年草の花") and "Perennial Grass," ("多年草の花.")
* All 1-AP data points are removed; plants that cannot be used in Coordinate are removed
* ✅ means the variaion is tested. ❌ means the variation can't be tested
* As of initial posting (09/11/2026) not all themes have data checked off.


